  "description": "Turns ASP.NET Core API controllers into MCP (Model Context Protocol) server tools using the official MCP C# SDK attributes, with ActionResult<T> unwrapping. Authorization follows your controllers: [Authorize], policies and [AllowAnonymous] are enforced by the SDK authorization filters for tools/list and tools/call.",
