  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.1 (security fix, drop-in for 3.0.0): a tool method inherited from a base controller now carries the class-level [Authorize] of the SCANNED controller, closing an authorization bypass where the derived policy was dropped and tools/list + tools/call enforced only the weaker base policy (GitHub issue #1). No API change. See CHANGELOG.md.",
